WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.630
Picture a tiny place
with almost no voters.

2
00:00:03.680 --> 00:00:06.350
It still elects members of Parliament.

3
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:09.370
Now picture a busy factory
town, growing fast,

4
00:00:09.420 --> 00:00:11.870
with no MP at all.

5
00:00:11.920 --> 00:00:13.610
Before eighteen thirty-two,

6
00:00:13.660 --> 00:00:17.910
only about one man in ten could
vote, and no women at all.

7
00:00:17.960 --> 00:00:20.330
So how did more people win a say?

8
00:00:20.380 --> 00:00:23.710
Did one great law give
everyone the vote at once?

9
00:00:23.760 --> 00:00:26.630
In this mission, you'll
meet the Great Reform Act,

10
00:00:26.680 --> 00:00:29.350
and the Chartists with
their huge petitions.

11
00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:32.810
You'll see the Act of Union join
Ireland with Great Britain,

12
00:00:32.860 --> 00:00:36.310
and reformers tackle
life in the new towns.

13
00:00:36.360 --> 00:00:40.110
Your mission: work out how
more people won the vote.
